    "detailed_description": "<strong>Empire of Lust</strong> \ud83c\udfdb  \u2014 Power. Pleasure. Rome.<br>In the heart of Ancient Rome, influence is everything \u2014 and no one knows how to climb the social ladder quite like you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/6527a7984a757a9d43b55113e16e3583.poster.avif?t=1755535815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/6527a7984a757a9d43b55113e16e3583.webm?t=1755535815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/6527a7984a757a9d43b55113e16e3583.mp4?t=1755535815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After your father\u2019s death, you return home to inherit not just a noble house... but its secrets, debts, and pleasures. Whispers of your decadent nature follow you \u2014 and you're ready to prove them right. But this time, it\u2019s not just for fun \u2014 it\u2019s for power.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/89be87bc167a723672be3c680f17eec2.poster.avif?t=1755535815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/89be87bc167a723672be3c680f17eec2.webm?t=1755535815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/89be87bc167a723672be3c680f17eec2.mp4?t=1755535815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You throw wild, unforgettable parties, seduce the city\u2019s elite, and build a harem of exquisite concubines \u2014 each woman more dangerous, desirable, and useful than the last. From a brilliant courtesan to a broken slave, a deadly stranger to a foreign princess \u2014 every beauty you claim unlocks new inspiration for the grandest events Rome has ever seen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/9b743eaabb740e2f6bd23707b9f64d13.poster.avif?t=1755535815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/9b743eaabb740e2f6bd23707b9f64d13.webm?t=1755535815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/9b743eaabb740e2f6bd23707b9f64d13.mp4?t=1755535815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>But beware: in a world of sex, politics, and betrayal, your greatest weakness might lie in the very arms that please you most.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:</h2>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Live the Roman fantasy</strong> \u2014 Step into the toga of a pleasure-loving patrician on a path to ultimate influence.<br>\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Build your harem</strong> \u2014 Seduce, win, or dominate a growing collection of unique and memorable concubines.<br>\ud83d\udc8b <strong>Pleasure as power</strong> \u2014 Your erotic encounters fuel your creativity and unlock new ways to grow your empire.<br>\ud83c\udfdb <strong>Manage your legacy</strong> \u2014 Throw lavish orgies, manipulate the nobility, and rise through society\u2019s ranks.<br>\u2694\ufe0f<strong> Lust, danger, betrayal</strong> \u2014 Every woman is a muse... or a threat. Choose wisely who to trust, tame, or punish.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/c46e42e47f96d069702f4e465792813a.poster.avif?t=1755535815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/c46e42e47f96d069702f4e465792813a.webm?t=1755535815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/c46e42e47f96d069702f4e465792813a.mp4?t=1755535815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Empire of Lust</strong>\ud83c\udfdb   is a visual novel for adults who crave power, intrigue, and unapologetic pleasure \u2014 set against the backdrop of a world where indulgence isn't a sin\u2026 it\u2019s a strategy.<br><br>",
